== Savings Ratio
Saving represents a decision to postpone consumption by saving money out of
disposable income.

== Why do people choose to save their incomes?
- Precautionary saving
- Building up potential spending power
- Interest rates and saving
- Inheritance
- Saving and the life-cycle of consumers

